UID:event_314296674@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260616T045054Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260619T193000
SUMMARY:Comedy on the River - A Unique Paddle-in Comedy Show! 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Come 
 Enjoy our Comedy On The River show on Friday June 19th!** To book your spo
 t\, please go to the link:\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/c
 omedy-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/com
 edy-shows-on-the-river/)\n\nLink will show live boat availability and opti
 ons!\n\n**Kayak or Canoe or Standup Paddle Board your way to a Comedy show
  right on the Humber River!**\n\nJoin us for laughter-filled evenings with
  talented comedians while enjoying the beautiful scenery of the Humber Riv
 er. Looking to try something truly unique?! Our super popular Comedy On Th
 e River paddle in comedy shows are back again for another season!\n\nLocat
 ed on Toronto’s beautiful Humb River our Comedy On The River event start
 s at our Humber Paddling centre which is only a 5-minute walk from Old Mil
 l TTC Station! Upon arrival\, we’ll get you signed in and set you up wit
 h your boat and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the m
 eandering Humber River to our Comedy Show located right on the river! Upon
  arrival you’ll be greeted by host Dan Galea\, and some of Toronto’s b
 iggest upcoming comedians!\n\n**Pricing (per boat)\, Payable online throug
 h:**\n**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/comedy-shows-on-the-r
 iver/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/comedy-shows-on-the-riv
 er/)**\n\n* Single Kayak (seats 1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\n* Tandem Kayak 
 (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\n* Regular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $79.9
 5 +taxes\n* Large Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxes\n* Stand Up Paddl
 eboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\n* Voyageur Canoe Seat (1 person): $39.9
 5 +taxes\n* Bring Your Own Boat (boat/equipment): $9.95 +taxes\n\n**What's
  Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A co
 medy show right on the river!\n* Our friendly staff to help you every step
  of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* Wear clo
 sed-toes athletic footwear you don't mind getting wet or muddy.\n* Blanket
  to keep you cozy during the show.\n* Snacks & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)\n* G
 overnment issued photo ID.\n\n**Important Information:**\n\n* Check specif
 ic event dates for start time and duration!\n* Anyone under 18 must be acc
 ompanied by an adult or legal guardian.\n* We Start & Finish this event at
  our Humber Location\, so no need for a shuttle.\n* Plan to arrive at leas
 t 15 minutes early for Check-In to ensure that you get out on time and enj
 oy the whole show.\n* Waivers to be signed on location.\n* Paddlers must b
 e comfortable treading water while wearing a PFD and reaching a shoreline 
 (minimum 20 metres to shore).\n\n**Cancellation & Weather**\n\n* *Events a
 re subject to weather and other factors out of our control. Any weather ca
 ncellations will be announced through email to booked attendees and on the
  home page of www.TorontoAdventures.ca.*\n\n**[Cancellation Policy](https:
 //torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**\n**[Google Link Directions](ht
 tps://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocation)**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/314296674/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260415T145609Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T145609Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
