SUMMARY:Music on the River
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\nThis ar
 tist is TBA\, but is sure to entertain! To book your spot\, please go to t
 he link:\n*[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the
 -river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/music-shows-on-the-ri
 ver/)*\nLink shows live boat availability and options!\n\nLocated on Toron
 to’s beautiful Humber River our Music On The River event starts at our H
 umber Paddling centre which is only a 5-Minute walk from Old Mill TTC Stat
 ion! Upon arrival we’ll get you signed in and set you up with your boat 
 and equipment before you embark on your scenic paddle of the meandering Hu
 mber River before enjoying a 45-Minute set from Popular Local Toronto Arti
 sts!\n\n***Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our cont
 rol. If we must cancel or delay an event we will let you know as soon as p
 ossible.***\n\n**Booking and Pricing:**\n[https://torontoadventures.ca/all
 -adventures/music-shows-on-the-river/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-ad
 ventures/music-shows-on-the-river/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) : $49.9
 5 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.95 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (se
 ats 2 people) : $79.95 +taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $99.95 +taxe
 s\nStand Up Paddleboard (1 person) : $49.95 +taxes\nBring Your Own Boat (b
 oat/equipment): $9.95 +taxes.\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Padd
 le(s)\n* PFD(s) “Lifejackets”\n* A concert right on the river!\n* Our 
 experienced staff to help you every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**
 \n\n* Dress for the weather!\n* Sunscreen\, Sunglasses & Hats\, are all re
 commended for sunny days!\n* Blanket to keep you cozy during the show\n* S
 nacks & Drinks (Non Alcoholic)\n* Don’t forget your Cameras!\n\n**[Googl
 e Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverloc
 ation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancel
 lation)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)\n\nWe hope to
  see you out on the water!
